flowchart LR
    subgraph Intake
        U[Reviewer browser<br/>upload / try a sample]
        M[Supplier email<br/>Mailpit or IMAP inbox]
    end

    subgraph Edge
        C[Caddy<br/>HTTPS + routing]
    end

    U --> C
    C -->|/| FE[Next.js frontend<br/>dashboard + review screen]
    C -->|/api| API[FastAPI api<br/>JWT auth, REST]
    FE -->|/api| API

    M --> N1[n8n intake workflow<br/>poll inbox, split attachments]
    N1 -->|POST /webhooks/intake<br/>shared secret| API

    API -->|original file| S3[(MinIO<br/>invoices bucket)]
    API -->|rows| PG[(Postgres<br/>backhouse db)]
    API -->|enqueue process_document| R[(Redis<br/>Celery broker)]

    R --> W

    subgraph W[Celery worker: process_document]
        direction TB
        T1[1. Load + sha256] --> T2[2. Text<br/>PyMuPDF text layer<br/>or Docling / PaddleOCR]
        T2 --> T3[3. Injection guard<br/>hidden text, layer vs OCR diff,<br/>Prompt Guard 2, keywords]
        T3 -->|sanitised, spotlighted text| T4[4. Extract<br/>Ollama qwen2.5 + JSON schema]
        T4 --> T5[5. Validate<br/>sums, dates, vendor,<br/>duplicates, price change]
        T5 --> T6{6. Decide}
        T6 -->|clean + confident| T7[7. Approve<br/>price history]
        T6 -->|anything uncertain| RV[needs_review]
    end

    T4 <--> OL[Ollama<br/>or OpenAI-compatible endpoint]
    T4 -.trace.-> LF[Langfuse web + worker<br/>ClickHouse, Redis, MinIO]
    W --> PG
    W --> S3

    RV --> FE
    FE -->|approve with corrections| API
    API --> T7

    T7 -->|POST webhook| N2[n8n export workflow]
    N2 -->|JSON-RPC: partner + account.move in_invoice| OD[Odoo 17<br/>Invoicing]
    N2 -->|POST /webhooks/exported| API
    N2 -->|price change or flagged| AL[Slack or email alert]
